"title1","maxW":2740},"desktop":{"x":0,"y":1000,"text":"Sign-up and sign-in on desktop (1280 × 900)","kind":"title1","maxW":8080},"about":{"x":2820,"y":0,"w":380,"size":"m","fill":"teal","text":"Sample people: Dana Okonkwo, director of Harbor Community Kitchen (dana@harborkitchen.org, password Harbor-2026), and Sam Rivera, a volunteer developer (GitHub samrivera).\n\nBoard 1 and board 7 are the whole sign-up: choose NGO or volunteer → Google, GitHub (volunteers) or email → check your email → finish sign-up → signed in.\n\nNGOs finish with the organisation name, their name, title, authority and the Terms + Platform Promise. Volunteers must link GitHub; the link is permanent.\n\nBoards 2 to 6 and 8 to 12 start the same flow at a later step. Platform admins are provisioned, never signed up."}},"designSystems":[]}
